      </div>

      <p>
        In that historical snapshot, decode was bandwidth-bound and the 9B
        weights were streamed each token. The retained engineering note
        reported roughly 69% of nominal bandwidth for hipfire and 37% for the
        compared llama.cpp ROCm path. The observation motivates the
